WEBVTT

00:06:57.356 --> 00:07:01.876
The trick is to really rethink
how we do agriculture.

00:07:01.916 --> 00:07:04.276
So there is the good news,

00:07:04.316 --> 00:07:06.436
which is there are some
tried and true ways

00:07:06.476 --> 00:07:10.116
that we can get more carbon
in our soils and build our soils back.

00:07:10.676 --> 00:07:12.556
We can plow less,

00:07:12.596 --> 00:07:16.676
and we can make sure that we have
roots in the ground year round,

00:07:16.716 --> 00:07:18.116
feeding the microbes

00:07:18.156 --> 00:07:21.396
and powering that microbial engine
humming under our feet.

00:07:22.036 --> 00:07:23.316
And we can do this.

00:07:24.436 --> 00:07:25.636
The other thing is,

00:07:25.636 --> 00:07:28.836
diversity is the key
ingredient in this recipe.

00:07:29.396 --> 00:07:33.756
Diverse plant communities
support diverse microbial communities